OL,3,ATrans people should use hospital spaces
OL,4,Aaccording to biological sex, NHS
OL,5,AEngland says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe guidance also says staff facilities
OL,8,Fshould be used by people based on their
OL,9,Fbiological sex, while trusts should
OL,10,Fensure enough alternatives to
OL,11,Fsingle-sex facilities, such as
OL,12,Fsingle-occupancy toilets, are offered.
OL,14,FPrevious NHSE guidance suggested
OL,15,Fpatients and staff could be
OL,16,Faccommodated on wards or use facilities
OL,17,Fbased on their gender identity.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
