OL,3,AMaduro pleads not guilty to new
OL,4,Atorture-related charges in New York
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenezuela's former leader Nicolas
OL,7,FMaduro and his wife, Cilia Flores,
OL,8,Fappeared in court on Thursday to plead
OL,9,Fnot guilty to new charges of conspiracy
OL,10,Fto commit torture.
OL,12,FThe US government initially accused
OL,13,FMaduro of narco-terrorism, drug
OL,14,Ftrafficking and weapons-related
OL,15,Foffenses, before adding new charges
OL,16,Fagainst him and Flores last week.
OL,18,FMaduro and Flores were captured in
OL,19,FJanuary during a US military raid,
OL,20,Fafter which they were taken to New
OL,21,FYork, where they remain in jail.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
