OL,4,Atorture-related charges in New York
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple has pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fthe allegations and both have argued to
OL,8,Fhave the case thrown out on the grounds
OL,9,Fthat they qualify for sovereign
OL,10,Fimmunity. Their trial is scheduled for
OL,11,FJune 2027.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
